One query though,
lo mivyskera'a je zbaskera'a po do
This section of the cll (http://dag.github.com/cll/14/12/) seems to suggest
that this would be a thing or things that are both technologically and
biologically intrinsic to you. Perhaps {ja} would capture the things that
are one or the other (or both).

ie lo X .e lo Y = lo X ja Y

mu'o mi'e ros

